10:43:38.452 [INFO]   [Reporting]   [main]              [com.diffblue.cover.ui.controller.aa] [Claude Code] 
10:43:38.452 [INFO]   [Reporting]   [main]              [com.diffblue.cover.ui.controller.aa] [Claude Code] I've resolved both R020 issues by adding new factory methods to the `TAQWriterFactory` class:
10:43:38.452 [INFO]   [Reporting]   [main]              [com.diffblue.cover.ui.controller.aa] [Claude Code] 
10:43:38.453 [INFO]   [Reporting]   [main]              [com.diffblue.cover.ui.controller.aa] [Claude Code] ### Issue 1: Temporary file '/tmp/test.txt' not deleted
10:43:38.453 [INFO]   [Reporting]   [main]              [com.diffblue.cover.ui.controller.aa] [Claude Code] **Affected methods:** `getBuffer()`, `getConfig()`, `getPosition()`, `getSink()`, and File-based constructors
10:43:38.453 [INFO]   [Reporting]   [main]              [com.diffblue.cover.ui.controller.aa] [Claude Code] 
10:43:38.453 [INFO]   [Reporting]   [main]              [com.diffblue.cover.ui.controller.aa] [Claude Code] **Solution:** Added two new factory methods that use in-memory `ByteArrayOutputStream` instead of file-based streams:
10:43:38.454 [INFO]   [Reporting]   [main]              [com.diffblue.cover.ui.controller.aa] [Claude Code] - `createTAQWriterForGetters()` - For testing getter methods without file I/O
10:43:38.454 [INFO]   [Reporting]   [main]              [com.diffblue.cover.ui.controller.aa] [Claude Code] - `createTAQWriterForGettersWithConfig()` - For testing getters with custom configuration
