10:43:38.455 [INFO]   [Reporting]   [main]              [com.diffblue.cover.ui.controller.aa] [Claude Code] ### Issue 2: Temporary file '/tmp/taq-test-*.txt' not deleted
10:43:38.455 [INFO]   [Reporting]   [main]              [com.diffblue.cover.ui.controller.aa] [Claude Code] **Affected methods:** `flush()`
10:43:38.456 [INFO]   [Reporting]   [main]              [com.diffblue.cover.ui.controller.aa] [Claude Code] 
10:43:38.456 [INFO]   [Reporting]   [main]              [com.diffblue.cover.ui.controller.aa] [Claude Code] **Solution:** Added two new factory methods that use in-memory streams to avoid file creation:
10:43:38.456 [INFO]   [Reporting]   [main]              [com.diffblue.cover.ui.controller.aa] [Claude Code] - `createTAQWriterForFlush()` - For testing the flush() method without creating temporary files
10:43:38.457 [INFO]   [Reporting]   [main]              [com.diffblue.cover.ui.controller.aa] [Claude Code] - `createTAQWriterForClose()` - For testing the close() method without NullPointerException or file cleanup issues
